#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:23
#: 71e13d361075474a93424980dc9b096f 7999a3d8010144cdab829b7a2d80804b
#: d258f7fcc45b401aa1fc2fb780d61869
msgid "FFT Averaging"
msgstr "FFT 平均"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:25
#: 78d836355b2f449bb69851c0b1fa4cd7 a67bd3a6b59d4d4f810a7cf959f616bd
#: f0793052783045d3aee98f82e9be52dd
msgid ""
"Instantaneous FFT's can suffer from noise and one way to reduce the noise is"
" to average a number of data frames together before performing the FFT. "
"Theory shows that this will reduce the noise by sqrt(N), where N is the "
"number of frames that are averaged, as long as the data is stationary. On a "
"multirotor the data is not stationary for very long because of changes in "
"throttle, thus usually only a small number of frames can be averaged. "
"Setting the parameter :ref:`FFT_NUM_FRAMES<FFT_NUM_FRAMES>` to a non-zero "
"value will average that number of frames to produce the FFT used by the "
"center frequency setting code. Experimentation will be required to determine"
" the optimum number of frames to be used, but is normally 2-5 frames."
msgstr ""
"瞬时 FFT 可能受噪声影响，减少噪声的一种方法是在执行 FFT 之前对多个数据帧进行平均。理论上，只要数据是平稳的，这将使噪声减少 "
"sqrt(N)，其中 N 是平均的帧数。在多旋翼上，由于油门变化，数据不会长时间平稳，因此通常只能平均少量帧。将参数 "
":ref:`FFT_NUM_FRAMES<FFT_NUM_FRAMES>` 设置为非零值，将平均该数量的帧以生成中心频率设置代码使用的 "
"FFT。需要通过实验确定最佳帧数，通常为 2-5 帧。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:28
#: 5cd3749a36d5485c873fbda47ba4bdd8 6fbe6899d7784efb80b4c08296d3ac6f
#: d5d6d19b7de5468c9bf93f6b21b9677a
msgid "Post Configuration Flight and Post-Flight Analysis"
msgstr "配置后飞行及飞后分析"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:30
#: 15edc39436e54ac2ae272c162eed0f26 1f67c11dfaee4c4ebf46a0af3e2941eb
#: c9f63524b6a645678cf57cab7abe095a
msgid ""
"With the dynamic harmonic notch configured perform another stable hover to "
"check that the motor noise peak has been :ref:`eliminated <common-imu-notch-"
"filtering-post-configuration-flight-and-post-flight-analysis>`. It is also "
"important to check that the autopilot is not overloaded for the FFT length "
"being used. Graph PM.Load and PM.NLon. PM.Load ideally should be below 60% "
"and PM.NLon in the low 10's - although experimentation shows that it is "
"possible to fly a Pixracer with an FFT length of 128 and CPU load of 90% "
"without instability."
msgstr ""
"配置动态谐波陷波后，再次进行稳定悬停，检查电机噪声峰值是否已 :ref:`消除 <common-imu-notch-filtering-post-"
"configuration-flight-and-post-flight-analysis>`。同样重要的是检查飞控是否因使用的 FFT "
"长度而过载。绘制 PM.Load 和 PM.NLon。PM.Load 理想情况下应低于 60%，PM.NLon 应在 10 左右 — 虽然实验表明，使用"
" 128 FFT 长度和 90% CPU 负载的 Pixracer 可以飞行而不会失稳。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:32
#: 1879cf35ed534cf78ee74eb8a0216b2d b5888ade2d3d49a49a6d73d2dd5c6267
#: f761977a9fde469bb3eb2b2964fa6120
msgid "Other points to check:"
msgstr "其他需要检查的要点："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:34
#: 16803901cab64f90ac140c7fe6e83970 d8d1a0b7c8d34113844d1b413316b870
#: fba8f20a7afb4dae812b58529724a08f
msgid ""
"The FFT will only analyse frequencies between :ref:`FFT_MINHZ <FFT_MINHZ>` "
"and :ref:`FFT_MAXHZ <FFT_MAXHZ>`. If your copter's motor rpm is outside "
"these bounds the results can be somewhat random, so make sure that these are"
" set appropriately for your copter. :ref:`FFT_MAXHZ <FFT_MAXHZ>` should not "
"be set above the Nyquist frequency, so a maximum of about 495Hz for most "
"copters using standard gyros."
msgstr ""
"FFT 只会分析 :ref:`FFT_MINHZ <FFT_MINHZ>` 和 :ref:`FFT_MAXHZ <FFT_MAXHZ>` "
"之间的频率。如果您的多旋翼电机转速超出这些范围，结果可能有些随机，因此请确保根据您的多旋翼适当设置这些值。:ref:`FFT_MAXHZ "
"<FFT_MAXHZ>` 不应设置高于奈奎斯特频率，因此对于大多数使用标准陀螺仪的多旋翼，最大约为 495Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:35
#: 89d39743264c4312ab3557899fc09e7a 99a5c9ffb7b141eca3f86508b7a46918
#: eb99275a662b43b78ae5e11b91530f06
msgid ""
"FTN1.SnX, FTN1.SnY and FTN1.SnZ give an indication of the signal-to-noise "
"ratio of the detected frequency. This value should be above "
":ref:`FFT_SNR_REF <FFT_SNR_REF>`. For the example flight in :ref:`common-"
"imu-fft-test-flight` the SNR was about 58dB."
msgstr ""
"FTN1.SnX、FTN1.SnY 和 FTN1.SnZ 给出检测到的频率信噪比的指示。该值应高于 :ref:`FFT_SNR_REF "
"<FFT_SNR_REF>`。对于 :ref:`common-imu-fft-test-flight` 中的示例飞行，SNR 约为 58dB。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:38
#: 2e3420b48bdf4ee2adef3a8e6d77ec85 8c54d328a42945ff87c2ff7439ab58bc
#: bfd87c73c1bd4c8e9adee0b6e39f0d6a
msgid ""
"Harmonic Notch Throttle Configuration Using Data from an In-Flight FFT Test "
"Flight"
msgstr "使用飞行中 FFT 测试飞行数据配置谐波陷波油门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:40
#: 1a86ef9a96d146178baf270fa957b9ed 4453d17c0d4c4bf8b90ffbcaadfac708
#: 8e16132ed1dc4f83a0e8412cacaa03e6
msgid ""
"It is also possible to use the in-flight FFT in a test flight to generate a "
"precise :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>`:ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>`. Then the In-Flight "
"FFT would be disabled and the data used to setup a throttle-based center "
"frequency for driving the dynamic harmonic notch. This has very low CPU cost"
" with minimal latency and can be a good option for certain applications. To "
"setup the harmonic notch this way:"
msgstr ""
"也可以在试飞中用飞行中 FFT 生成精确的 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 和/或 "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ <INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>`。之后关闭飞行中 FFT，用这些数据设置基于油门的中心频率来驱动动态谐波陷波。这种方式 CPU "
"开销极低、延迟极小，对某些应用是不错的选择。按以下方式设置谐波陷波："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:42
#: 4201790cdecf47ccbd9cb34f8030bc34 c1472b6583c1471fab222e393755fd17
#: da0c41cfc88c4fbb8f63cdbc7cc71958
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FFT_MINHZ <FFT_MINHZ>` to the lowest value that you want the "
"harmonic notch frequency to be set to. Typically this should be above about "
"50Hz to stay clear of your copter's control bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FFT_MINHZ <FFT_MINHZ>` 设置为您希望谐波陷波频率被设置的最低值。通常应高于约 50Hz，以远离多旋翼的控制带宽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:43
#: 74f980440d87456585d09c17dab6fecc 8521df799ed04cdca47299c8edda5d3e
#: e386956234ee49c5a1703386e5895db9
msgid "Set :ref:`FFT_ENABLE <FFT_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable the FFT engine."
msgstr "将 :ref:`FFT_ENABLE <FFT_ENABLE>` = 1 以启用 FFT 引擎。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:44
#: 8b514152f98b471a9c9a009ec0f5b3d0 b42c8c779b4e46268e053e4bd2484cb5
#: f517d6ec2e1c401fa3be8a6a478ef092
msgid ""
"Perform a stable lengthy hover as you might do for learning the hover "
"throttle with the sticks on the transmitter not being moved while in a hover"
" or loiter. Moving the sticks while in hover or letting the vehicle loiter "
"in wind (ie the autopilot is moving the sticks to hold position) stops hover"
" learning until the vehicle attitude is returned to neutral VTOL stance."
msgstr ""
"进行稳定的长时间悬停，就像您在遥控器摇杆不移动的情况下学习悬停油门一样。在悬停或 Loiter "
"时移动摇杆（即飞控为保持位置而移动摇杆）会停止悬停学习，直到飞行器姿态恢复到中立垂直起降姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:45
#: 076177cf93b440edba367e17dbce021b 2d8a12407d0f4cdf8f62981f9070894b
#: c13153bd202e462383668127a18fcbce
msgid ""
"Land and disarm. The learned value for :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ <INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` at hover "
"will be in :ref:`FFT_FREQ_HOVER <FFT_FREQ_HOVER>` and the learned value for "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` to scale :ref:`FFT_MINHZ <FFT_MINHZ>` "
"to the learned hover frequency will be in :ref:`FFT_THR_REF <FFT_THR_REF>`. "
"The values are not transferred automatically to the harmonic notch so you "
"should set them based on the learned values."
msgstr ""
"降落并上锁。悬停时 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` 的学习值将在 :ref:`FFT_FREQ_HOVER <FFT_FREQ_HOVER>` 中，将 "
":ref:`FFT_MINHZ <FFT_MINHZ>` 缩放到学习的悬停频率的 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF "
"<INS_HNTCH_REF>` 学习值将在 :ref:`FFT_THR_REF <FFT_THR_REF>` "
"中。这些值不会自动传输到谐波陷波，因此应根据学习值手动设置。"

