#: e24871a661bf42b2b71de9ec71e98822
msgid ""
"Small multicopters are generally characterized by a very pronounced motor "
"rpm frequency peak. The peak is generally the first harmonic and there are "
"rarely other significant harmonics. For this reason it can be sufficient to "
"target the first harmonic alone. By default, the FFT engine tracks the top "
"three frequency peaks and these can be observed by graphing FTN2[N].PkX for "
"each peak. PkX is the noise on the roll axis. Here is an example from a 4\" "
"quad:"
msgstr ""
"小型多旋翼通常具有非常明显的电机转速频率峰值。峰值通常是基频，很少有其他显著谐波。因此，仅针对基频可能就足够了。默认情况下，FFT "
"引擎跟踪前三个频率峰值，可通过绘制每个峰值的 FTN2[N].PkX 来观察。PkX 是横滚轴上的噪声。以下是 4 英寸四轴的示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:74
#: 09837c4c4ce44e07bf55940cc2e2ad6d 6f199519d43f40ceb4661565d1d12378
#: 8ed8a477f7eb46f7a705756f38f32f5a
msgid ""
"As can be seen the roll and pitch axes track the main frequency peak quite "
"closely and the secondary peaks are essentially tracking noise. "
"Unfortunately this noise sometimes looks like the highest energy peak and "
"can distort the primary tracked frequency. If this is the case it is "
"possible to force the FFT engine to only track the primary peak by setting:"
msgstr ""
"可以看到横滚和俯仰轴相当紧密地跟踪主频率峰值，次要峰值基本上是跟踪噪声。不幸的是，这些噪声有时看起来像是能量最高的峰值，可能扭曲主跟踪频率。如果是这种情况，可以通过设置以下参数强制"
" FFT 引擎只跟踪主峰值："

