msgstr "将 :ref:`FFT_HMNC_PEAK <FFT_HMNC_PEAK>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:78
#: 9dbeba2017c1413ba85eda2a8ba5361a caa048cac7f1452b979ec3ede06866f7
#: ccd2bd27a6e54452a24de9a5bd0550c1
msgid ""
"It is also possible to set :ref:`FFT_HMNC_PEAK <FFT_HMNC_PEAK>` to 2 and 3 "
"to track the second and third peaks respectively."
msgstr "也可以将 :ref:`FFT_HMNC_PEAK <FFT_HMNC_PEAK>` 设置为 2 和 3，分别跟踪第二和第三峰值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:80
#: 8ba2bc5c7e0f457eafd5a7970b41efa1 972e81698f2c4aaf94bd7e40ae284b4c
#: f1a0f056964b4c4f8dfaee41ff77d0c2
msgid ""
"Another important metric for small copters is the frequency energy. This is "
"most easily visualized by graphing the signal-to-noise ratio of the "
"frequency energy, which is the ratio in dB of the gyro noise at startup to "
"the gyro noise of the detected frequency peak in flight. Here is an example "
"from the same 4\" quad:"
msgstr ""
"对小型多旋翼来说另一个重要指标是频率能量。最直观的方式是绘制频率能量的信噪比曲线，即飞行中检测到的频率峰值处陀螺仪噪声与启动时陀螺仪噪声之比（单位 "
"dB）。下面是同一台 4 寸四轴的示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:86
#: 56b8d8dba0c14915afc22710ad516c0c e50c66ed045e4c429a94e9a10f156fbb
#: f3123d76213d445a96918ef0edc5af55
msgid ""
"As can be seen there is a strong signal at about 50dB on roll and 40dB on "
"pitch. The FFT engine uses the setting :ref:`FFT_SNR_REF <FFT_SNR_REF>` to "
"determine whether a detected frequency peak is actually a signal or just "
"noise. The default setting is 25dB and so in this example the peak is "
"correctly detected as a signal."
msgstr ""
"可以看到，横滚轴约 50dB、俯仰轴约 40dB 处有一个很强的信号。FFT 引擎使用 :ref:`FFT_SNR_REF <FFT_SNR_REF>`"
" 设置来判定检测到的频率峰值究竟是信号还是噪声。默认值为 25dB，因此本例中该峰值被正确判定为信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:88
#: 0343e1aa1f8b42a1b42c5179551758a0 ea1f5e857d494d6188daaa9c6080e6b4
#: fe9a3ce21b934e6886ae1f4a6e0da071
msgid "Let's look at a smaller copter. This is a 3\" quad in a stable hover:"
msgstr "大型多旋翼飞行器（4英寸及以上桨叶）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:94
#: 0a1ac81e98c24a69a5042557d4bf3cdb 4486fadd97604ff2ad65e872cc08c4fd
#: a2428112c6c245538679833f76146bd8
msgid ""
"This time you can see that the signal-to-noise ratio is right around the "
"25dB mark and if :ref:`FFT_SNR_REF <FFT_SNR_REF>` was set to 25dB then the "
"detected peak would be treated as noise a significant amount of the time. So"
" for this copter I have set :ref:`FFT_SNR_REF <FFT_SNR_REF>` to 15dB in "
"order to detect the peak correctly. Mechanically it's easy to see why this "
"is necessary - the same MEMS gyros are used in pretty much all autopilots, "
"but the difference in vibrational energy of 10\" props versus 3\" props is "
"enormous. Thus it is likely that for smaller builds it will be necessary to "
"reduce :ref:`FFT_SNR_REF <FFT_SNR_REF>`."
msgstr ""
"这次可以看到信噪比正好在 25dB 附近——如果 :ref:`FFT_SNR_REF <FFT_SNR_REF>` 设为 "
"25dB，检测到的峰值会有相当多的时间被当成噪声。所以对这台多旋翼我把 :ref:`FFT_SNR_REF <FFT_SNR_REF>` 设为 "
"15dB，以正确检出峰值。从机械上很容易理解为什么必须这样做：几乎所有飞控用的都是同款 MEMS 陀螺仪，但 10 寸桨与 3 "
"寸桨的震动能量差异巨大。因此小机架很可能需要调低 :ref:`FFT_SNR_REF <FFT_SNR_REF>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:98
#: 10141930e82d40e482c69dfccd8ab9ca 4983738eaaff4954bd54cd14f5ef6acd
#: 59f407b7f4274a0db7acabb866aeb7a1
msgid "Tuning Large MultiCopters"
msgstr "基于 FFT 的谐波陷波滤波器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:100
#: 2d127782f5c94f2797ebc18e5687a2e6 81ad428740e048168cab2d778204bb8e
#: d8fb441d705c42e1b8e365c2e9ea0b0d
msgid ""
"Small multicopters are relatively simple from a noise perspective - the "
"motors have nice, clean noise profiles and picking the noise frequency is "
"algorithmically a relatively simple task. Larger multicopters are much more "
"complex. There is much more noise energy and this noise energy can appear in"
" unexpected places. On any copter motor noise frequencies will diverge "
"during yaw due to the different motor rpms employed to effect a yaw "
"manoeuvre. This divergence can also be seen as you add more motors - for "
"instance Y6 or X8 configurations - or for any kind of imbalance - for "
"instance Y6 with difference prop sizes in a coaxial configuration. These "
"differences can make the fundamental harmonic frequency hard to find. Here "
"are the detected frequency peaks for a Y6B:"
msgstr ""
"从噪声的角度看，小型多旋翼相对简单——电机的噪声特征干净漂亮，用算法找出噪声频率相对容易。大型多旋翼要复杂得多：噪声能量大得多，而且可能出现在意想不到的地方。任何多旋翼在偏航时，由于各电机以不同转速实现偏航机动，电机噪声频率都会发散。电机越多（如"
" Y6 或 X8 构型）、或存在任何不平衡（如共轴异桨径的 Y6），这种发散越明显。这些差异会让基频谐波难以确定。下面是一台 Y6B 检测到的频率峰："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:106
#: 16aa727e1cc7451f911e4aeb8db70660 a5671af27dc94f7f9a827b12faf11689
#: f79ec94b555c449fbf23d2a694a481d2
msgid ""
"As you can see the noisiest motor peak is around 150Hz, with the second "
"noisiest around 75Hz. Then the third noisiest peak appears to be jumping "
"between 120Hz and 225Hz. So what is going on here? Well, the frequency that "
"the motors are turning at is indeed 75Hz, but the frequency that the FFT "
"would target by default is 150Hz. From a control perspective this is bad. "
"The harmonic notch targets increasing harmonics of the fundamental "
"frequency, so if the harmonic notch is configured to target 150Hz then the "
"75Hz noise peak will not be notch filtered at all. 75Hz is getting down into"
" the control frequencies of the aircraft and therefore ignoring this noise "
"can be extremely problematic. The 150Hz signal is nice and clear, but the "
"flip flopping between 120Hz and 225Hz seems odd. Mechanically this can be "
"understood when you think about the configuration of my Y6B. It has larger "
"props on the topside meaning that upper and lower props are almost certainly"
" turning at different frequencies. It also is balanced around the centerline"
" but slightly imbalanced front to back. This combination of factors means "
"that there will be at least two fundamental harmonics, and this is almost "
"certainly what the 120Hz signal is. The 225Hz signal is then the third "
"harmonic of the 75Hz fundamental. So how do we target notches appropriately?"
" We clearly want 75Hz to be treated as the fundamental harmonic. "
"Fortunately, by default ArduPilot has :ref:`FFT_HMNC_PEAK <FFT_HMNC_PEAK>` "
"set to 0, which means \"auto\". In auto mode the autopilot tries to detect "
"the situation where one frequency is the harmonic of another frequency and "
"will return the lower frequency for use by the harmonic notch filter. This "
"works quite well on quads, but on my Y6B the relationship is too soft to be "
"useful - probably because of the 120Hz harmonic confusing things. So in this"
" instance setting :ref:`FFT_HMNC_PEAK <FFT_HMNC_PEAK>` to 2, will allow us "
"to accurately target the first harmonic."
msgstr ""
"可以看到，噪声最大的电机峰值约在 150Hz，第二大的约在 75Hz，而第三大的峰值似乎在 120Hz 与 225Hz "
"之间跳动。这是怎么回事？其实电机的转动频率确实是 75Hz，但 FFT 默认锁定的频率是 "
"150Hz。从控制角度看这很糟糕：谐波陷波瞄准的是基频的整数倍谐波，如果谐波陷波配置为 150Hz，那么 75Hz 的噪声峰将完全不被陷波。75Hz "
"已经低到接近飞机的控制频率，忽略这个噪声可能造成严重问题。150Hz 的信号清晰明确，但 120Hz 与 225Hz "
"之间的跳动看起来很怪。从机械上想想我这台 Y6B "
"的构型就能理解了：它上层用更大的螺旋桨，意味着上下桨几乎必然以不同频率旋转；它绕中轴平衡，但前后略有不平衡。这些因素叠加意味着至少存在两个基频谐波，120Hz"
" 的信号几乎可以肯定就是其中之一，而 225Hz 则是 75Hz 基频的三次谐波。那么如何正确地设置陷波目标？我们显然希望把 75Hz "
"当作基频谐波。幸运的是，ArduPilot 默认把 :ref:`FFT_HMNC_PEAK <FFT_HMNC_PEAK>` 设为 "
"0，即\"自动\"。自动模式下，飞控会尝试检测某一频率是另一频率的谐波这种情况，并把较低的频率交给谐波陷波滤波器使用。这在四轴上工作得很好，但在我的 "
"Y6B 上这种关系太弱而不可用——多半是 120Hz 的谐波把事情搅乱了。所以在这个例子中，把 :ref:`FFT_HMNC_PEAK "
"<FFT_HMNC_PEAK>` 设为 2 就能准确锁定一次谐波。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:108
#: 10e1c540e61e4b0d95e00a9418145b64 63b6a1692101438e9fbb57ba761779a5
#: aeeeabadfcd1430e985a862320daa48e
msgid ""
"Things get more confusing when we look at the different axes. Here is roll, "
"pitch and yaw for the highest energy peak on the same Y6B :"
msgstr "本页面假设您已按照 :ref:`初始 FFT 测试飞行<common-fft-test-flight>` 进行操作并正确设置了 FFT。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:114
#: 25a2667d877243aea70c8ddf8267cc08 2d6eebf665964e76aeaac617cd682ead
#: 3de6328afd58427da93fddf454d6af56
msgid ""
"As you can see roll is tracking quite nicely, pitch is flipping a little "
"between the first and second harmonics and yaw is flipping all the time. "
"Having different peaks detected on different axes is not uncommon on larger "
"copters and can be problematic for the harmonic notch as the frequency used "
"is the energy-weighted average of roll and pitch axes. If roll and pitch are"
" tracking different peaks then the energy weighted average will be somewhere"
" in-between - totally useless for the purposes of notch filtering."
msgstr ""
"可以看到，横滚轴跟踪得相当好，俯仰轴在一次谐波与二次谐波之间偶有跳动，而偏航轴则一直在跳。在较大的多旋翼上，不同轴检测到不同峰值并不罕见，但这对谐波陷波是个麻烦：其使用的频率是横滚和俯仰轴的能量加权平均值。如果横滚和俯仰跟踪的是不同的峰值，能量加权平均将落在两者之间——对陷波滤波来说毫无用处。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:116
#: 01c72f0faa65498392c8c9b22021ce00 04a630ed14124fac9878e07030c95264
#: 7c620068f1ac46c1a22cc36b661f2f06
msgid ""
"In order to address this problem it is possible to set :ref:`FFT_HMNC_PEAK "
"<FFT_HMNC_PEAK>` to 4 to track the roll-axis only or 5 to track the pitch-"
"axis only."
msgstr ""
"为解决这个问题，可以把 :ref:`FFT_HMNC_PEAK <FFT_HMNC_PEAK>` 设为 4 只跟踪横滚轴，或设为 5 只跟踪俯仰轴。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:118
#: 282b16fd9ae94c6f90738a13bf0e0ab2 651fc39b5f8543a0b798db3b0e34036b
#: 9eeb60049f034bf4a1b129d3427aaedd
msgid ""
"Finally, it is possible - as is clearly the case here - that the noisiest "
"peaks are not necessarily harmonics of one another. In this case it is "
"possible to configure the harmonic notch to track the frequency peaks "
"directly by setting bit two of :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` and/or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` - so to 2 if no other options are "
"configured. This results in very accurate frequency tracking and lower "
"noise. Here is the log from a Solo with "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` and/or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` set to 3 - dynamic harmonics and "
"double notch:"
msgstr ""
"最后，噪声最大的那些峰值也可能彼此并不构成谐波关系——本例显然如此。这时可以通过设置 "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` 和/或 "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` 的位 2（若未配置其他选项则设为 "
"2），让谐波陷波直接跟踪各频率峰。这样频率跟踪非常精确、噪声更低。下面是一台 Solo 的日志，其 "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` 和/或 "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` 设为 3——动态谐波加双陷波："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-advanced-setup.rst:124
#: 639dbbf442fa4de8bedcb737c98205f8 643f2bed170b47d58ba41da96fcc75d3
#: 92aab394c5a8429fbbd7415609e2eb9f
msgid ""
"You can see that the dynamic notch frequency is tracking the two highest "
"noise peaks precisely, resulting in a significant reduction in noise."
msgstr "频率分辨率 = 采样率 / 窗口大小。例如，采样率为 1 kHz、窗口大小为 32 时，频率分辨率为 31.25 Hz。"
